  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Wash and dry the fresh produce."
    },
    {
      "text": "Zest and juice lemon into a blender. (Alternatively, the dip can be prepared in a food processor.)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain and rinse beans. Add to the blender."
    },
    {
      "text": "Add water, tahini, oil, and spices to the blender. Blend on high for several minutes until smooth. Add more water, 1 tablespoon at a time, if needed, to reach desired consistency. Set aside."
    },
    {
      "text": "Trim, seed, and slice bell peppers lengthwise into ¾-inch wide strips."
    },
    {
      "text": "To serve, divide dip and bell pepper strips between plates. Enjoy!"
    }
  ]
